     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Toireasa Ferris daughter of Martin Ferris Sinn Fein and Mayor of Kerry . Pictured in Kerry County Council Chambers today as council members wanted to remove her from her pisition as Mayor of Kerry.. 20/2/06&#xA;Photo By: Domnick Walsh/Eye Focus.Â©&#xA;Tralee, Co Kerry Ireland.&#xA;Phone : 087/2672033.&#xA;L/line : 066/7122981.</rdf:li>
