     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">9/5/2008 Sinn Fein No To Lisbon. Sinn Fein's President Gerry Adams(M) with  L TO R Aengus O Snodaigh, Caoimhghin O Caolain, MEP Mary Lou McDonald and Campaign Director Councillor Padraig McLochlainn on their way into a press conference at Buswells Hotel for the launch of their No to Lisbon Campaign. Pic Leon Farrell/Photocall Ireland</rdf:li>
