     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">07/06/2008. Sinn Fein Leader Gerry Adams and Mary Lou McDonald canvass support for voting NO in the Lisbon Treaty Referendum on the EU Constitution, today in Dublin City centre at Moore Street. Photo: Sasko Lazarov/Photocall Ireland.</rdf:li>
